This is a new independently developed plugin, classified by the user on 2026-10-18.
It uses the public Dalamud IMarketBoard purchase/request/offering API (goatcorp,
AGPL-3.0): https://github.com/goatcorp/Dalamud
No upstream plugin repository or market implementation has been copied.
Dalamud and its bindings are host dependencies, not redistributed in this ZIP.
The shared StandardPluginTabs.cs implementation is copied exactly from the
Roxyz0501 workspace template. Language labels and font-atlas usage were informed
by the author's BaitBeacon project: https://github.com/Roxyz0501/BaitBeacon
Only selected shared UI behavior is reused; Market Ledger's purchase tracking,
storage, search, export and charts are independently implemented here.

SQLite is provided by Windows winsqlite3.dll; no SQLite binary is bundled.
The Noto Sans CJK font is provided by Dalamud (SIL Open Font License 1.1);
no font files or game artwork are bundled. The icon is original geometric art.
